      <h1>How it works</h1>
      <p class="lead">Three steps from a first conversation to an agreement you approve.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section mist">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ol class="path">
        <li class="reveal">
          <h2>We learn about your data</h2>
          <p>A short call to understand what your company holds and whether it fits what the buyers look for.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal">
          <h2>We put it in front of the buyers</h2>
          <p>If there is a fit, we make the introduction and hand over the conversation.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal">
          <h2>You choose the terms you accept</h2>
          <p>Each buyer runs its own diligence. Nothing is agreed without your sign-off.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section teal-soft">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="reveal">What you are agreeing to, and what you are not</h2>
      <p class="reveal">Booking a call does not license anything, and it does not appoint us as your agent for anything else. There is no listing, no public profile and no obligation to continue past the first conversation.</p>
      <p class="reveal">If a scope goes ahead, it is the buyer&rsquo;s terms you sign rather than ours: the licence, the deletion date, the audit right and the payment schedule all sit in that agreement. We are paid by the buyer, so nothing is deducted from what your company receives.</p>
      <p class="link-row reveal"><a href="what-you-can-sell.html">The published floors</a> <a href="what-affects-a-deal.html">What affects a deal</a> <a href="where-to-sell.html">Where to sell</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section mist">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="reveal">Before anything moves</h2>
      <p class="reveal">Each buyer reviews whether the data can be licensed and sets the scope in writing before anything moves. If something is unclear, you hear it directly, and your own counsel can review the agreement.</p>
      <div class="checks reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="icons.svg#i-shield"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Rights to license</h3>
          <p>Whether your contracts and the terms of your tools allow these records to be licensed at all.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="icons.svg#i-lock"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Consent and personal data</h3>
          <p>What personal information the records hold, and how it is removed or transformed.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="icons.svg#i-clock"/></svg></span>
